/target
# The repo-root .gitignore has a blanket `output/` rule (for generated content); re-include
# our Rust `src/output/` source module so it is tracked.
!src/output/
!src/output/**
# Data assets reused as-is — never commit
/collection_cache.db
/collection_cache.db-wal
/collection_cache.db-shm
/discogs_cache/
/config.json
/secrets/
/logs/
/backups/
*.db-journal
backup_*.db
# Web UI: resized artwork cache, and the built app (embedded at compile time)
/.cache/
/web/dist/
/web/node_modules/
